{"id": 4695, "name": "Salacoa Creek Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://gordoncountyga.gov/348/Salacoa-Creek-Park", "lines": ["tric motors only). | Fishing. | 1.5 mile nature trail. | 2 playgrounds. | Fees | Swimming: Memorial Day Weekend to Labor Day Weekend. Friday, Saturday, Sunday, (and Mondays on holiday weekends) noon-7 pm. Swimming Fees: $3 for adults and $2 for students and 5 and under free | Fishing: Is year round. Electric Motors Only. The speed rule for the lake is 10 mph. $3 per person per day. (Ages 10 and under FREE/Ages 60 and", "Saturday, Sunday, (and Mondays on holiday weekends) noon-7 pm. Swimming Fees: $3 for adults and $2 for students and 5 and under free | Fishing: Is year round. Electric Motors Only. The speed rule for the lake is 10 mph. $3 per person per day. (Ages 10 and under FREE/Ages 60 and over are FREE) | Boat Rental: $10 per 3 hrs. | Picnic Pavilion: BY RESERVATION - 8 hours $60. The Pavilion can accommodate about 100 people a", "ear round. Electric Motors Only. The speed rule for the lake is 10 mph. $3 per person per day. (Ages 10 and under FREE/Ages 60 and over are FREE) | Boat Rental: $10 per 3 hrs. | Picnic Pavilion: BY RESERVATION - 8 hours $60. The Pavilion can accommodate about 100 people and include a grill, and picnic tables. Electricity is available. | RV Camping: Seasonal Dates are the first weekend in April to the first weekend in", "l Dates are the first weekend in April to the first weekend in November. Contact the Park caretaker for reservations of RV sites. There is no minimum allowed time on RV sites. Maximum stay of 14 days. | RV Camping Fees: $28 per night per RV site. Each site includes water, electricity, picnic table, fire pit, and deck. | Tent camping: $18 per night per site. | Free Activities: 1 mile nature trail and playground | Cont"]}, {"url": "https://gordoncountyga.gov/101/Services", "lines": [], "via": "Services"}, {"url": "https://gordoncountyga.gov/645/Online-Services-Payments", "line